      "assistant_text": "According to the [[credential-scoping]] page, the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** \u2014 specifically, the Ingest agent (and Query agent) receives the credential injected into its own process environment at the moment it spawns, rather than being held in the Hub\u0027s process environment.\n\nThe key detail is that a local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it **only into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process, immediately before that process starts**. This ensures the Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated and cannot leak the credential.",
